o grips with the changing world around them.<br></li><li>Customise and rearrange your city\u2019s layout by moving buildings and find the perfect combination for your city to grow.<br></li><li>Expand across multiple neighbourhoods of your city, discovering new landmark characters and districts.   </li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/945740/extras/931eb820d0cb1143126ac32542784c6c.poster.avif?t=1738065039\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/945740/extras/931eb820d0cb1143126ac32542784c6c.webm?t=1738065039\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/945740/extras/931eb820d0cb1143126ac32542784c6c.mp4?t=1738065039\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
